#: ../../administration/settings/settings.rst:2
msgid "Settings"
msgstr "Avertissement"

#: ../../administration/settings/settings.rst:4
msgid ""
"The |AdmSet| section sets global configuration parameters for the "
"|morpheus| appliance, whitelabeling, provisioning, monitoring, backups, "
"logs, software licenses, and the license for |morpheus| itself."
msgstr "Critique"

#: ../../administration/settings/settings.rst:7
msgid "Appliance"
msgstr "Paramètres"

#: ../../administration/settings/appliance.rst:2
msgid "Appliance Settings"
msgstr "La section |AdmSet| définit les paramètres de configuration globaux pour l'appliance |morpheus|, la marque blanche, le provisionnement, la surveillance, les sauvegardes, les journaux, les licences logicielles et la licence de |morpheus| lui-même."

#: ../../administration/settings/appliance.rst:4
msgid "Appliance URL"
msgstr "Appliance"

#: ../../administration/settings/appliance.rst:5
msgid ""
"The default URL used for Agent install and Agent functionality. All "
"Instances and Hosts must be able to resolve and reach this URL over 443 "
"for successful agent install and communication."
msgstr "Paramètres de l'appliance"

